# parler
===
 Open-source voice dictation app for macOS, Windows and Linux. Hold a shortcut, speak, and your words are typed in any app. Cloud speech-to-text with Groq, OpenAI, Fireworks or any Whisper-compatible server; your API key stays on your computer. A free alternative to Wispr Flow and SuperWhisper..
